    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Welcome Aboard\nUnited Aixlines\nye\n*ararma",
      "United Airlines Wine Cellar\nUnder the direction of authox and veteran wine judge Bol Thompson, United Airlines Cellax Committee\neach year conducts a rigorously controlled blind tasting to choose six superiox American wines\nfrom a field of more than 100. Of these, you will be offered one of our bellax's\nwhite and red wines on today's flight.\nRed Wine\nCabernet Sauvignon\nBuena Vista Sonoma-barneros 1984, Resenve\nFrom one of balifornia's coolest vineyard districts,\nthe Buena Vista Reserve is tart, lively, represhing.\nFetzer Lake Country 1984\nUpland vineyards in Lake County yield a light,\nmarkedly fruity Cabernet ideal fox early use.\nJ. Pedroncelli Sonoma 1983\nThe Pedroncelli shows fully developed Cabernet flavors\nplus welcome overtones from long ageing in barrel.\nWhite Wine\nChardonnay\nCorbelt Canyon Central Coast 1986, Coastal Classic\nCoastal Classic typified its grape's flavor in the bentral boast —\nPan Luis Obispo and Santa Barbara counties.\nGlen Ellen California 1985, Proprieton's Reserve\nSo gentle and polished is this Chardonnay that it tastes\nalmost as pleasant alone as in the company of food.\nSauvignon Blanc\nBeaulien Vineyard Napa Valley 1985\nSauvignon Blanc can be overwhelmingly flavonful,\nbut Beaulien tames the variety to perfection.\nSparkling Wines\nHanns Kornell Brut\nTrue to its name, Kornell is patterned after traditional German sparkling wine."
    ],
